{{!
    @template qtype_questionpy/iframe_question_content

    Content within the question's iframe. In particular, the HTML returned by the question package is put in
    this iframe.

    The HTML structure is similar to how Moodle embeds the question formulation to make it look the same.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * question - question html
    * feedback - feedback html

    Example context (json):
    {
        "question": "Question HTML",
        "feedback": "Feedback HTML"
    }
}}
<div class="que">
    <div class="content">
        <div class="formulation clearfix">
            <form id="qpy-formulation">
                {{{ question }}}
            </form>
        </div>
        {{{ feedback }}}
    </div>
</div>
